### Fetch All Plans
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans
Authorization: Basic {{keyId}}:{{keySecret}}

### Fetch Specific Plan
GET {{baseUrl}}/plans/plan_PLAN_ID_HERE
Authorization: Basic {{keyId}}:{{keySecret}}

### ===== LEGACY PLANS (for grandfathering early customers) =====

### Create Founding Member Plan (₹699 forever)
POST {{baseUrl}}/plans
Authorization: Basic {{keyId}}:{{keySecret}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "period": "monthly",
  "interval": 1,
  "item": {
    "name": "RestoHand Founding Member - Monthly",
    "amount": 69900,
    "currency": "INR",
    "description": "Special founding member rate. Locked forever at ₹699/month with Professional features."
  },
  "notes": {
    "tier": "founding_member",
    "billing_cycle": "monthly",
    "locations": "3",
    "tables": "unlimited",
    "features": "advanced_analytics,priority_support,custom_branding,inventory_alerts",
    "special": "founding_member_forever_rate"
  }
}

